Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.55,0:22:39.75,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,5000)\pos(680,316)\fs36\frz-90\1c&H662627&}会
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:40.00,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,200,500,5200)\fs36\frz-90\1c&H662627&\pos(681.429,397.714)}？
