Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.06,0:19:02.50,INJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,292,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(8125,8440,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}お互いの気持ちはいつも　側にいるよ
